#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "SM RFQ"
msgstr "SM RFQ"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid ""
"Requests for quotation: buyers describe what they need (profile rows weighed"
" by SM Weight Engine or free description, quantity, delivery place and date,"
" drawings); suppliers and manufacturers answer with a price, a price per kg "
"and a delivery time; the buyer compares the offers, contacts suppliers and "
"accepts one. Notifications in French and Arabic. Requires SM Core, SM Weight"
" Engine and SM Products."
msgstr ""
"طلبات عروض الأسعار: يصف المشتري حاجته (مقاطع موزونة عبر SM Weight Engine أو "
"وصف حر، الكمية، مكان وتاريخ التسليم، المخططات)؛ يرد الموردون والمصنعون بسعر "
"وسعر للكيلوغرام وأجل تسليم؛ يقارن المشتري العروض ويتواصل مع الموردين ويقبل "
"أحدها. إشعارات بالفرنسية والعربية. يتطلب SM Core وSM Weight Engine وSM "
"Products."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

