msgid ""
"SM RFQ needs the SM Core, SM Weight Engine and SM Products plugins. Activate"
" them first."
msgstr ""
"يتطلب SM RFQ إضافات SM Core وSM Weight Engine وSM Products. فعّلها أولًا."

